"<strong>Repair &amp; Optimize DB</strong> WordPress database repair and optimization\n"
"<strong>Clear All Visitor Data</strong> Purge hits, counters, and statistics\n"
"<strong>Clear Transients</strong> Remove expired WordPress transients\n"
